concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by items 2, 3, 5, 7 and 8 apply in relation to applications made on or after the commencement of those items. (2) However, the amendment made by item 2 does not apply in relation to a person if:  (a) the person makes an application on or after that commencement; and  (b) the Minister is satisfied that the person had, before that commencement, sat a test approved in a determination under section 23A of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 and successfully completed that test (worked out in accordance with that determination).  Schedule 2  Amendments relating to special residence requirement" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by items 2, 3, 5, 7 and 8 apply in relation to applications made on or after the commencement of those items. (2) However, the amendment made by item 2 does not apply in relation to a person if:  (a) the person makes an application on or after that commencement; and  (b) the Minister is satisfied that the person had, before that commencement, sat a test approved in a determination under section 23A of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 and successfully completed that test (worked out in accordance with that determination).  Schedule 2  Amendments relating to special residence requirement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "79160cf954860c3ec2c361bf58370a88463144669df5f47ce7e7c736e3def87a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conditional commencement for certain amendments" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
