concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2009(4) No. 90, 2009"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2009-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(f), the Minister may treat a period as one in which the applicant was a permanent resident if the Minister considers that, because of an administrative error, the applicant was not a permanent resident during that period." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(f), the Minister may treat a period as one in which the applicant was a permanent resident if the Minister considers that, because of an administrative error, the applicant was not a permanent resident during that period."@en ;
