concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-test-review-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-22b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22B(4) Special residence requirement—persons engaged in particular"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(f), the Minister may treat a period as one in which the person was a permanent resident if the Minister considers that, because of an administrative error, the person was not a permanent resident during that period." ;
