doc:sch-2-sec-22b-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22B(5) Special residence requirement—persons engaged in particular" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(g), the Minister may treat a period as one in which the person was not present in Australia as an unlawful non-citizen if the Minister considers the person was present in Australia during that period but, because of an administrative error, was an unlawful non-citizen during that period.  Schedule 2  Amendments relating to special residence requirement" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

